": "Gorillaz", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Grimes", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Imagine Dragons", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "hard rock": {"genre": "hard rock", "country_code": "by", "country_name": "Belarus", "summary": "Hard rock is a loosely defined genre of rock music which has its earliest roots in mid-1960s garage, blues rock and psychedelic rock. It is typified by a heavy use of distorted electric guitars, bass guitar, drums, pianos, and keyboards.\n\nOne of the major influences of hard rock is blues music. American and British rock bands began to modify rock and roll, adding to the standard genre harder sounds, heavier guitar riffs, bombastic drumming and louder vocals.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Bring Me the Horizon", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Disturbed", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Metallica", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "My Chemical Romance", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Papa Roach", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Queen", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Scorpions", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "System of a Down", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Three Days Grace", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "hip-hop": {"genre": "hip-hop", "country_code": "by", "country_name": "Belarus", "summary": "Hip-Hop, also spelled Hip Hop or HipHop is a rhythm focused popular music style, originating from New York in The 70s. The term rap is sometimes used synonymously with Hip-Hop music. Hip-hop arose when DJs began isolating the percussion break from funk or disco songs for audiences to dance to.\nIt is now seen as a worldwide and popular genre ranging from American Mainstream (e.g. Eminem, Lil Wayne) to British Underground (e.g. Wiley, EMC Junkie ect).", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "madk1d", "streams": 16839, "best_position": 8}, {"artist": "Kai Angel", "streams": 11152, "best_position": 5}, {"artist": "FORTUNA 812", "streams": 7414, "best_position": 16}, {"artist": "Noize MC", "streams": 2139, "best_position": 46}, {"artist": "A$AP Rocky", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Beyonc\u00e9", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Doja Cat", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Eminem", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Gorillaz", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Kanye West", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Kendrick Lamar", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Lil Peep", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "industrial": {"genre": "industrial", "country_code": "by", "country_name": "Belarus", "summary": "Industrial music is a style of experimental music that draws on transgressive and provocative themes. The term was coined in the mid-1970s with the founding of Industrial Records by the band Throbbing Gristle, and the creation of the slogan \"industrial music for industrial people\". In general, the style is harsh and challenging. Allmusic defines industrial as the \"most abrasive and aggressive fusion of rock and electronic music\"; \"initially a blend of avant-garde electronics experiments tape music.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "FORTUNA 812", "streams": 7414, "best_position": 16}, {"artist": "Depeche Mode", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Disturbed", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Marilyn Manson", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Rammstein", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "The Prodigy", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "metal": {"genre": "metal", "country_code": "by", "country_name": "Belarus", "summary": "A metal is a material that exhibits a lustrous appearance when polished or fractured and conducts electricity and heat relatively efficiently. These properties are associated with the presence of electrons at the Fermi level. Metals are typically ductile, allowing them to be drawn into wires, and malleable, enabling them to be shaped by hammering or pressing.\n\nA metal may be a chemical element, such as iron, an alloy such as stainless steel, or a molecular compound such as polymeric sulfur nitride.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Bad Omens", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Bring Me the Horizon", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Deftones", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Disturbed", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Evanescence", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Korn", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Limp Bizkit", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Linkin Park", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Marilyn Manson", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Metallica", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Nirvana", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Papa Roach", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "metalcore": {"genre": "metalcore", "country_code": "by", "country_name": "Belarus", "summary": "In the 1980s, various bands in both hardcore punk and metal scenes worldwide were crossing over. In terms of metalcore, the mid-1980s New York hardcore scene in particular is arguably the most influential. The likes from this scene, such as Cro-Mags, Leeway, and Judge , took inspiration from popular metal bands of the time such as Venom, Mot\u00f6rhead, Celtic Frost, Metallica, and Slayer. At this point, \"metalcore\" was used to describe some of these bands.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Bad Omens", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Bring Me the Horizon", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Falling in Reverse", "streams": null, "best_position"